      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The women bless the LORD who has not left Naomi without a redeemer, who shall be a restorer of life. Boaz's redemption of Ruth brings forth Obed, the grandfather of David, pointing directly to Jesus Christ the Redeemer of the world. First principle: God uses redemption to graft Gentiles into the messianic line and bring life out of bereavement.",
